var e=JSON.parse(`[{"id":"4.1","title":"Seventy-Two Hours","capitulo":"72 Hours","text":["Seventy-two hours. That's all you got before the Integrity Engineer erases the evidence, the safehouse, and both of you.","Kaeda pulls up the Yohualticit building map on the terminal. Floor by floor. Door by door.","[KAEDA] \\"There are three ways to get to him. Each one depends on what you've built so far.\\"","---","I'm gonna tell you the most important thing I know, then I'll shut up: in the end, nobody gets to the top with what they won. They get there with what they became.","{veia:1} You see the whole building as open source. Every door is a question. You already know the answer to almost all of them.","{veia:2} Your fists been wrapped for two days. You don't remember doing it. Your body already decided how this ends.","{veia:3} On your wall there's the whole picture. Time, money, position, signature. Only one thing missing: somebody with the guts to show it.","{veia:4} You already know what this man wants, what he fears, and what he's worth. Every man has a price. His is written all over the terminal screen.","{veia:5} The static is a full voice now. It doesn't tell you what to do. It just keeps saying one thing: *you're not alone in here*.","---","[KAEDA] \\"Choose.\\""],"choices":[{"id":"A","label":"Bust in through the main arena and face him","requer":{"hab":23},"flags_set":["ROTA_COMBATE"],"decisao":true,"next_scene":"4.1a_combate"},{"id":"B","label":"Throw it all in the world's face","flags_required":["PISTA_FINANCEIRA"],"flags_set":["ROTA_EXPOSICAO"],"decisao":true,"next_scene":"4.1b_exposicao"},{"id":"C","label":"Sit down with him face to face","flags_required":["PISTA_CARGO","PISTA_NPC"],"flags_set":["ROTA_NEGOCIACAO"],"decisao":true,"next_scene":"4.1c_negociacao"},{"id":"D","label":"Go in now, any way you can","flags_set":["ROTA_DESPREPARADO"],"next_scene":"4.1d_despreparado"}]},{"id":"4.1a_combate","title":"Through the Front Door","text":["The dumbest way in. Which is exactly why he won't see it coming.","Nobody hits Yohualticit through the main arena, with three billion people watching. Nobody's that crazy.","You are.","Kaeda adjusts your SBI without a word. When she's done, she holds your face with both hands, like a mom right before school.","[KAEDA] \\"He's gonna fight dirty. No rules at all.\\"","You know the one rule of a street fight. Everybody in Marelia knows it.","There are no rules.","You jack in. The main arena builds itself around you—huge, empty, the stands dark.","And in the middle of it, waiting, a thing that isn't quite human."],"choices":[{"id":"A","label":"Walk to the center","flags_set":["CONFRONTO_FINAL"],"next_scene":"4.1a-briga"}]},{"id":"4.1a-briga","title":"NULL_ENTITY","luta":"NULL_ENTITY","text":["You find the gap. The half second between him rewriting the arena and it finishing loading.","And you don't let go."],"choices":[{"id":"A","label":"Finish","next_scene":"4.2_vitoria","luta":8}]},{"id":"4.1b_exposicao","title":"In the World's Face","text":["You hand the whole dossier over to the Organization. Logs, transfer, signature, timestamp. Everything.","The Organization has a press contact at MDR. Writers who cover the LDI, people scared of Yohu, people who've been waiting years for a story this big.","[KAEDA] \\"The proof is solid. When it breaks, he'll have nowhere to run.\\"","You wait. The shelter goes quiet like a hospital waiting room.","One hour. An hour and a half.","Then PowWow blows up. One video, then a hundred, then ten thousand. The hashtag climbs to the top of the world. Everyone who ever lost a late-night fight in the last two years wants to know the Engineer's name.","[SISTEMA] \\"ENG_INTEGRIDADE_47: ACCESS REVOKED. INTERNAL INVESTIGATION INITIATED.\\"","You won without throwing a punch.","Some people think that's a lesser win. Those people never saw a man get taken down by his own signature."],"choices":[{"id":"A","label":"Look at Kaeda","flags_set":["VITORIA_EXPOSICAO"],"next_scene":"4.2_vitoria"}]},{"id":"4.1c_negociacao","title":"Coffee","text":["You set the meet on MDR. Out there, in the real world. A corner bakery in Marelia, plastic table, drip coffee.","No SBI. No arena. Nothing he can rewrite.","He shows up late. Skinny guy, deep bags under his eyes, cheap suit that used to be expensive. Orders a pingado and doesn't touch it.","Doesn't look like a villain. Looks like a guy who made one wrong call, then another to cover the first, then twenty more.","You show the evidence on your phone. He reads it all without blinking. When he's done, his hand is shaking on the cup.","[ENGENHEIRO] \\"You're not turning this in.\\"","[ENGENHEIRO] \\"If you do, I lose everything. The job, the house, my freedom. I have a daughter.\\"","He takes a deep breath.","[ENGENHEIRO] \\"I'll give you the names. Who bet. Who paid me. People way bigger than me. In exchange, you let me walk away.\\"","{veia:4} He's not lying about the daughter. But he's lying about something else. You can see it in the way he holds his phone face-down."],"choices":[{"id":"A","label":"Take the names and let him go","flags_set":["ACEITOU_ACORDO"],"decisao":true,"next_scene":"4.1c_acordo"},{"id":"B","label":"Stand up and turn everything over to the Organization","flags_set":["RECUSOU_ACORDO"],"decisao":true,"next_scene":"4.1b_exposicao"}]},{"id":"4.1c_acordo","title":"The Names","text":["You take the deal. He slides a chip across the table, under the napkin.","[ENGENHEIRO] \\"Honestly? Thank you.\\"","He gets up, leaves the coffee untouched and the cash on the table. At the door, he turns.","[ENGENHEIRO] \\"I know I don't deserve this.\\"","And he vanishes onto the sidewalk, an ordinary guy in a sea of ordinary guys.","---","Kaeda doesn't agree. She says it with silence, which is the loudest way she knows how to talk.","[KAEDA] \\"You're a better person than me. I hope you're right.\\"","You two open the chip.","And the names lead to places even she never imagined. Gamblers, sponsors, suits at the top of corporate towers, and a name at the end of the list that makes Kaeda slam the terminal shut on the spot.","This is bigger than one dirty engineer. Way bigger."],"choices":[{"id":"A","label":"Stash the chip","flags_set":["VITORIA_NEGOCIACAO"],"next_scene":"4.2_vitoria"}]},{"id":"4.1d_despreparado","title":"Hardheaded","text":["You don't have all the proof. No good plan. Not even a bad one.","You got nerve. Or you're just hardheaded. Up close, they look the same.","Kaeda stands between you and the door.","[KAEDA] \\"You're not ready. Wait a day. Just one.\\"","[KAEDA] \\"If you go in like this, the odds are slim. Real slim.\\"","She's not bluffing. She never does. She's real scared, and it's for you.","You look at the door. Then at her."],"choices":[{"id":"A","label":"Push past her and go in anyway","flags_set":["CONFRONTO_DESPREPARADO"],"decisao":true,"next_scene":"4.1d-briga"},{"id":"B","label":"Sit down. She's right","flags_set":["VOLTOU_PREPARO"],"next_scene":"4.1"}]},{"id":"4.1d-briga","title":"No Plan","luta":"NULL_ENTITY","text":["You walk in with no plan, no proof, and no Kaeda in your ear.","NULL_ENTITY is waiting for you in the middle of the arena, like it knew you were coming. Of course it did.","[NULL_ENTITY] \\"You came alone. That makes this easier.\\"","The first hit slams you flat on your back. The second blacks out half your vision. The third you never even see—you just taste iron in your mouth and your rank tanking in red numbers.","Out there, in the three-by-three room, your real body is in a cold sweat. The Immersor creaks like it did on day one.","One choice left. Maybe your last."],"choices":[{"id":"A","label":"Throw everything your Veia taught you into this fight.","requer":{"hab":[13,23,33,43,53]},"decisao":true,"next_scene":"4.2_vitoria_desperado","luta":8,"next_falha":"4.2_derrota"},{"id":"B","label":"Get up on nothing but arm and stubbornness.","next_scene":"4.2_derrota"}]},{"id":"4.2_vitoria","title":"Legend","destaque":true,"text":["It's over.","The Integrity Engineer isn't a threat to anyone anymore. NULL_ENTITY is just another deleted line in a log nobody's gonna read.","Kaeda drops down next to you on the shelter floor. Wiped. Smiling. She actually smiles now, sometimes. Still looks weird on her face, but less.","[KAEDA] \\"We did it.\\"","She takes her time with the next one. Picks her words like she's picking where to step.","[KAEDA] \\"But that was just the door. Whoever paid the Engineer has a name. And that name knows you exist.\\"","[KAEDA] \\"Kronos knows you exist.\\"","---","Fifteen days ago you were nobody. Rank one million and change, a third-hand SBI, and a three-by-three room on the edge of Marelia.","Today on PowWow people are asking your name. Wrong, but they're asking.","That's how a legend starts. Not with a clean punch. With someone who fell, got back up, and refused to be erased.","[SISTEMA] \\"FILE: SEASON 1 COMPLETE.\\""],"choices":[{"id":"A","label":"See your journey","next_scene":"fim:vitoria"}]},{"id":"4.2_vitoria_desperado","title":"Barely","destaque":true,"text":["You stand up.","I can't explain how. There was nothing left to get you up. But you get up, and when you do, whatever you learned in those fifteen days gets up too.","{veia:1} You stop fighting him and start fighting the arena. You yank the loose wire nobody saw and his arena unravels like cheap stitching.","{veia:2} Your body takes over. Canvas. You don't think about a single move. You just remember every time you fell and got back up, and you get back up one more time.","{veia:3} You saw it. A while ago. Before every hit he looks at the same corner of the arena, the same log. You get to the corner first.","{veia:4} \\"Your bosses already sold you out, you know?\\" He freezes. Just a second. People who live on lies can't handle a well-placed truth.","{veia:5} The static turns into a scream with a thousand voices, ancient, from long before the LDI. And for a second they fight alongside you.","---","The NULL_ENTITY's digital body dissolves into corrupted data.","You won. Barely. HP in the red, SBI boiling, the back of your neck burning out there.","Kaeda steps into the arena and yanks you out a second before the system locks up.","[KAEDA] \\"You're crazy.\\"","She helps you up.","[KAEDA] \\"But you pulled it off. Rest. Tomorrow we'll see how bad the damage is.\\""],"choices":[{"id":"A","label":"See your journey","next_scene":"fim:vitoria"}]},{"id":"4.2_derrota","title":"Lights Out","text":["NULL_ENTITY was stronger.","You get up once. Twice. Third time, the ground doesn't come back.","Your avatar fizzles into pixels. The arena vanishes. The blue vanishes.","---","You wake up in the three-by-three room, the Immersor still whining and the light flickering because of the neighbor's cat.","The SBI's fried. Smells like melted plastic. The Organization's mod went with it. Four months of savings and fifteen days of life, up in smoke.","You call Kaeda. She doesn't answer.","You call again. Nothing.","Outside, Marelia sounds the same as always. A motorcycle climbing the hill, the dog barking at nothing, the funk that never sleeps.","You lost. But let me tell you something I picked up on the street: losing ain't the end of anyone. The end is not coming back.","And every Veia's got another path."],"choices":[{"id":"A","label":"See your journey","next_scene":"fim:derrota"}]}]`);export{e as default};
//# sourceMappingURL=act4-BbW0_SFf.js.map